---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: bevy_post_process::bloom::bloom · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_resource fill:#F8F4EE,stroke:#A5792C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_system_set fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_plugin fill:#F1F3F6,stroke:#4A6389,stroke-width:2.2px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_order stroke:#334155,stroke-width:2px
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_set_membership stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.4px,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  classDef edge_registration stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bloom**<br/>通过降采样和上采样合成 HDR 光晕。" }
  class n0 node_system
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**post​_​processing**<br/>组合执行色差、暗角和镜头畸变。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**PostProcess**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​core​_​pipeline ↗：划分<br/>二维相机绘制与后处理阶段。" }
  class n2 node_system_set
  class n2 external_node
  n3@{ shape: cyl, label: "**PipelineCache**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：缓存 GPU 渲<br/>染、计算管线与待创建队列。" }
  class n3 node_resource
  class n3 external_node
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**UpsamplingPipelineIds**<br/>记录 Bloom 主上采样及最终合成管线。" }
  class n4 node_component
  n5@{ shape: cyl, label: "**ComponentUniforms#lt;BloomUniforms#gt;**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：汇集同类组件<br/>的动态 Uniform 数据。" }
  class n5 node_resource
  class n5 external_node
  n6@{ shape: rounded, label: "**Bloom**<br/>为 HDR 相机配置亮部扩散光晕。" }
  class n6 node_component
  n7@{ shape: cyl, label: "**DiagnosticsRecorder**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：记录渲染诊断<br/>区间与 GPU 查询索引的对应。" }
  class n7 node_resource
  class n7 external_node
  n8@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "**BloomPlugin**<br/>准备并合成画面辉光。" }
  class n8 node_plugin
  n9@{ shape: cyl, label: "**RenderDevice**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：创建渲染和计<br/>算所需的 GPU 资源。" }
  class n9 node_resource
  class n9 external_node
  n10@{ shape: rounded, label: "**BloomDownsamplingPipelineIds**<br/>记录 Bloom 首级和后续降采样管线。" }
  class n10 node_component
  n11@{ shape: rounded, label: "**BloomBindGroups**<br/>缓存视图 Bloom 各级降采样和上采样绑定。" }
  class n11 node_component
  n12@{ shape: rounded, label: "**BloomTexture**<br/>保存 Bloom 逐级缩小的中间纹理。" }
